  "prompt": "How many order lines fall in each size band? Use the sales table. size_band is the text 'small' when net_revenue_eur is under 50.00, 'medium' when it is 50.00 or more but under 100.00, 'large' when it is 100.00 or more, and 'unknown' when net_revenue_eur is missing. Return two columns, in this order: size_band and n_lines, the number of order lines in the band. Return one row per size band that has at least one line. Any row order is fine.",
